Z||000000||Carrolles||01-12-2000||06:57 AM||||I plan to install a set of gages from an 85 SE v-6 (including rally gages) in my 85 SE v-6.  I hope this will help me see the gages better at night since the 86 set is backlit.<BR>I read a post some time back that it is possible to reset the odometer.  I want to set the new odometer to match the reading on my existing one.<P>Has anyone done this before?  If so can you tell me how to go about it?<P>Thanks,<P>Carroll||||reg||1
Z||000001||Wolfhound||01-12-2000||07:49 AM||||I,m not postive but I believe the odometer units are the same for both the backlit guages and the standard guages. If this is the case you can just keep your odometer unit. I will check this later today and get back to you. I have both type guage clusters disassembled in the shop. <P>Coy ||||reg||1
Z||000002||DJRice||01-12-2000||08:20 AM||||Wolfhound is correct, you can swap the odometer assemblies and install the rally gauges with no problem.  I put a set in my 84 2m4 over the Christmas Holiday.  Definitely easier to see.||||reg||1
